{"b":"Job","c":13,"v":[{"n":1,"t":"Lo, mine eye hath seen all this, mine ear hath heard and understood it.","it":[[27,32]],"x":[["Job.4.12",2,"w"],["Job.42.3",2,"w"],["Job.42.6",2,"r"],["Job.8.8",2,"r"],["Job.8.10",2,"r"],["Job.5.9",2,"r"],["Job.5.16",2,"r"],["Job.15.17",2,"w"],["Job.15.18",2,"r"],["Job.12.9",2,"r"]]},{"n":2,"t":"What ye know, the same do I know also: I am not inferior unto you.","it":[[14,22],[41,43]],"x":[["Job.12.3",7,"w"],["2Cor.11.16",3,"r"],["2Cor.11.18",3,"r"],["2Cor.12.11",3,"r"],["Job.40.4",2,"r"],["Job.40.5",2,"r"],["1Cor.8.1",2,"r"],["1Cor.8.2",2,"r"],["Job.35.16",2,"r"],["2Cor.11.4",2,"r"]]},{"n":3,"t":"Surely I would speak to the Almighty, and I desire to reason with God.","x":[["Isa.41.21",5,"r"],["Job.31.35",3,"w"],["Job.13.22",3,"r"],["Job.9.3",3,"r"],["Isa.1.18",3,"w"],["Isa.1.20",3,"r"],["Job.23.3",2,"r"],["Job.23.7",2,"r"],["Jer.12.1",2,"r"],["Jer.12.2",2,"r"]]},{"n":4,"t":"But ye are forgers of lies, ye are all physicians of no value.","it":[[7,10],[31,34]],"x":[["Ps.119.69",6,"r"],["Jer.8.22",4,"r"],["Jer.6.14",4,"r"],["Mark.2.17",3,"r"],["Jer.30.13",3,"r"],["Job.16.2",3,"r"],["Jer.46.11",3,"r"],["Jer.23.32",3,"w"],["Ezek.34.4",3,"r"],["Hos.5.13",3,"r"]]},{"n":5,"t":"Oh that ye would altogether hold your peace! and it should be your wisdom.","x":[["Prov.17.28",6,"w"],["Job.13.13",4,"w"],["Eccl.5.3",3,"r"],["Jas.1.19",3,"r"],["Job.18.2",2,"r"],["Job.19.2",2,"r"],["Job.21.2",2,"r"],["Job.21.3",2,"r"],["Job.32.1",2,"r"],["Amos.5.13",2,"r"]]},{"n":6,"t":"Hear now my reasoning, and hearken to the pleadings of my lips.","x":[["Job.21.2",2,"r"],["Job.21.3",2,"r"],["Job.34.2",2,"r"],["Prov.8.6",2,"w"],["Prov.8.7",2,"w"],["Job.33.1",2,"w"],["Job.33.3",2,"w"],["Judg.9.7",2,"w"]]},{"n":7,"t":"Will ye speak wickedly for God? and talk deceitfully for him?","x":[["Job.36.4",3,"r"],["Job.32.21",2,"r"],["Job.32.22",2,"r"],["Job.4.7",2,"r"],["Job.11.2",2,"w"],["Job.11.4",2,"r"],["John.16.2",2,"r"],["Job.27.4",2,"r"],["2Cor.4.2",2,"w"],["Job.17.5",2,"r"]]},{"n":8,"t":"Will ye accept his person? will ye contend for God?","x":[["Prov.24.23",3,"r"],["Mal.2.9",2,"r"],["Job.34.19",2,"r"],["Exod.23.2",2,"r"],["Exod.23.3",2,"r"],["Job.32.21",2,"w"],["Lev.19.15",2,"w"]]},{"n":9,"t":"Is it good that he should search you out? or as one man mocketh another, do ye so mock him?","it":[[79,81]],"x":[["Jer.17.10",4,"w"],["Gal.6.7",4,"r"],["Gal.6.8",4,"r"],["Ps.44.21",3,"w"],["Ps.139.23",2,"w"],["Job.17.2",2,"r"],["Job.34.36",2,"r"],["Isa.28.22",2,"r"],["Job.12.16",2,"r"]]},{"n":10,"t":"He will surely reprove you, if ye do secretly accept persons.","x":[["Jas.2.9",3,"w"],["Job.42.7",2,"r"],["Job.42.8",2,"w"],["Ps.82.2",2,"w"],["Ps.50.21",2,"w"],["Ps.50.22",2,"r"]]},{"n":11,"t":"Shall not his excellency make you afraid? and his dread fall upon you?","x":[["Job.31.23",3,"r"],["Ps.119.120",3,"w"],["Matt.10.28",2,"r"],["Jer.5.22",2,"r"],["Jer.10.10",2,"r"],["Isa.8.13",2,"w"],["Rev.15.3",2,"r"],["Rev.15.4",2,"r"],["Exod.15.16",2,"w"],["Job.13.21",2,"w"]]},{"n":12,"t":"Your remembrances are like unto ashes, your bodies to bodies of clay.","it":[[18,21]],"x":[["Job.18.17",2,"r"],["Ps.34.16",2,"r"],["Gen.18.27",2,"w"],["Ps.102.12",2,"r"],["Gen.2.7",2,"r"],["Prov.10.7",2,"r"],["Ps.109.15",2,"r"],["2Cor.5.1",2,"r"],["Exod.17.14",2,"r"],["Isa.26.14",2,"r"]]},{"n":13,"t":"Hold your peace, let me alone, that I may speak, and let come on me what will.","it":[[73,78]],"x":[["Job.7.11",4,"r"],["Job.13.5",3,"w"],["Job.21.3",3,"r"],["Job.6.9",2,"r"],["Job.6.10",2,"r"],["Job.10.1",2,"r"],["Job.7.15",2,"r"],["Job.7.16",2,"w"]]},{"n":14,"t":"Wherefore do I take my flesh in my teeth, and put my life in mine hand?","x":[["Judg.12.3",5,"e"],["Ps.119.109",4,"r"],["1Sam.28.21",3,"e"],["Job.18.4",3,"r"],["1Sam.19.5",3,"e"],["Eccl.4.5",3,"w"],["Isa.9.20",2,"w"],["Isa.49.26",2,"w"]]},{"n":15,"t":"Though he slay me, yet will I trust in him: but I will maintain mine own ways before him.","x":[["Ps.23.4",24,"w"],["Job.23.10",19,"r"],["Job.19.25",18,"r"],